<Slide
  notes={`（2:25–2:50）仿真要分两层看。上面三行是工作过程：20 kHz 方波戴上载波，包络变成两个平台，摘下来还原成方波。下表是实测前的仿真值：模块级都过了——载波 30.9988、邻频抑制 11 到 14 dB、接收单体 5.1 Vpp；但接上 90 cm 天线模型，v2 只有 2.427 Vpp，离 4 V 差 1.65 倍。端到端还没闭合。`}
  style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: '60px 60px 0 60px', background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}
>
  <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#111111', lineHeight: 1.25 }}>
      仿真验证：模块级已达标，端到端仍有缺口
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#DCDCDC', marginTop: 12 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 20, gap: 32 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 640, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Image src='assets/fig_wave.png' style={{ width: 640, height: 300 }} />
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#111111' }}>尚未闭合的关键问题</Text>
        <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#E6E6E6', marginTop: 12 }} />

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 18 }}>
          <Text style={{ width: 26, fontSize: 15, color: '#D9534F' }}>①</Text>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#111111' }}>调制度与接收链的匹配</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6B6B6B', marginTop: 5, lineHeight: 1.45 }}>实际 m ≈ 26.5%，S05 按 50% 设计</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 12 }}>
          <Text style={{ width: 26, fontSize: 15, color: '#D9534F' }}>②</Text>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#111111' }}>发射端与天线阻抗匹配</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6B6B6B', marginTop: 5, lineHeight: 1.45 }}>天线电容 ±15%，电流降到约 1/3</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 12 }}>
          <Text style={{ width: 26, fontSize: 15, color: '#D9534F' }}>③</Text>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#111111' }}>接收端过载与动态范围</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6B6B6B', marginTop: 5, lineHeight: 1.45 }}>20 mV 输入时基带级削底</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 12 }}>
          <Text style={{ width: 26, fontSize: 15, color: '#D9534F' }}>④</Text>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#111111' }}>6 m 无线传输尚未实测</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6B6B6B', marginTop: 5, lineHeight: 1.45 }}>受天线效率、匹配与周围环境影响，须实物验证</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 12 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', paddingBottom: 9, borderBottom: '1px solid #111111' }}>
        <Text style={{ width: 180, fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#111111' }}>验证项</Text>
        <Text style={{ width: 760, fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#111111' }}>仿真结果（非实物测量）</Text>
        <Text style={{ width: 220, fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#111111' }}>状态</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 40, alignItems: 'center', borderBottom: '1px solid #E6E6E6' }}>
        <Text style={{ width: 180, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#111111' }}>载波频率</Text>
        <Text style={{ width: 760, fontSize: 16, color: '#333333' }}>30.9988 MHz（零步长外推），偏差 0.004%</Text>
        <Text style={{ width: 220, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F4E79' }}>达标</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 40, alignItems: 'center', borderBottom: '1px solid #E6E6E6' }}>
        <Text style={{ width: 180, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#111111' }}>邻频抑制</Text>
        <Text style={{ width: 760, fontSize: 16, color: '#333333' }}>11.4~13.7 dB，29 / 33 MHz 处</Text>
        <Text style={{ width: 220, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#6B6B6B' }}>设计目标</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 40, alignItems: 'center', borderBottom: '1px solid #E6E6E6' }}>
        <Text style={{ width: 180, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#111111' }}>接收链单体</Text>
        <Text style={{ width: 760, fontSize: 16, color: '#333333' }}>约 5.1 Vpp（10 mV 射频输入，S05 调制度 50%）</Text>
        <Text style={{ width: 220, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#6B6B6B' }}>条件成立</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 40, alignItems: 'center', borderBottom: '1px solid #E6E6E6' }}>
        <Text style={{ width: 180, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#111111' }}>90 cm 天线候选</Text>
        <Text style={{ width: 760, fontSize: 16, color: '#333333' }}>2.427 Vpp（332 线圈，m = 26.45%），缺口 1.65 倍</Text>
        <Text style={{ width: 220, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F' }}>未达 4 V</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-start', paddingTop: 10 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A8A8A' }}>31 MHz 模拟调幅无线方波传输系统　·　方案汇报</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A8A8A' }}>06 / 07</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
